WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.701
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:03.736
We're back in the studio.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.271
We hope you're doing well
and now,

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.873
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:09.642
President Biden is reportedly
planning to communicate

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.777
more directly
with the American people,

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:13.646
in an effort to increase
his poll numbers,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.850
so, you might want to switch
to the unlimited plan.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.117
"Uh-huh, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.151
Build Back Better, right.

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:20.386
No, okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.222
Yeah, yeah.
No, Amtrak's great.

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:25.258
Listen, I have to be like up
in like four hours.

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.792
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:29.462
House Democrats are reportedly
urging party leaders

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:32.498
to abandon President Biden's
Build Back Better bill

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:35.167
and, instead, break up
the proposals into a series

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.736
of smaller defeats.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:39.338
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:41.041
The Senate today took up debate

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.342
on a House-passed
voting rights package

00:00:43.342 --> 00:00:44.943
that combines
the Freedom to Vote Act

00:00:44.943 --> 00:00:47.747
and the John R. Lewis
Voting Rights Advancement Act.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.315
Of course,
it's already dead in the water,

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.383
thanks to Can't Act
and Won't Act.

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:53.319
[ Laughter and oohs ]

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.988
In a new interview, political
strategist James Carville said

00:00:55.988 --> 00:00:59.025
that Democrats should,
"Just quit being a whiny party

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.794
and get out there and fight
and tell people what you did."

00:01:01.794 --> 00:01:02.862
Said Democrats,

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:04.697
[ Whining ]
"That sounds hard!"

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.832
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.832 --> 00:01:08.968
Former New York Mayor
Bill de Blasio announced today

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.869
that he will not run
for governor.

00:01:10.869 --> 00:01:12.204
He then announced
something else,

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:14.973
but no one heard it
over the thunderous applause.

00:01:14.973 --> 00:01:17.109
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.109 --> 00:01:19.646
A video gained attention online
over the weekend

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:23.315
of Oklahoma Pastor Mike Todd
spitting in his hand

00:01:23.315 --> 00:01:26.285
and rubbing it onto his
brother's eyes during a sermon,

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:28.721
[ Audience ohs ]
which is weird for a pastor,

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:31.557
but very on-brand
for an older brother.

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:34.794
[ Laughter,
smattering of applause ]

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.029
Health officials
in Greece yesterday

00:01:37.029 --> 00:01:38.630
imposed a vaccine mandate

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.867
for all citizens
over 60 years old.

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:43.369
So, if you're a 60-year-old
in Greece,

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.370
you're Rizzo.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.406
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.576
[ Applause ]

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.512
I had a very depressing thing
just happen where,

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.715
you know, there was one person
enthusiastically liked it

00:01:55.715 --> 00:01:59.018
and I'm like, "Well, at least
there's one audience member here

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.219
worth their salt!"

00:02:00.219 --> 00:02:02.121
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:04.390
Then I turned around
and it was Amber.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.925
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.427
It was our writer Amber Ruffin.

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:10.262
[ Laughter and applause ]
And now, I'm starting to think

00:02:10.262 --> 00:02:13.032
you didn't even laugh
at the joke!

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:15.401
I know, Amber, you were laughing
at how it went!

00:02:15.401 --> 00:02:16.903
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:18.571
You're out of the Pink Ladies!

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.607
[ Laughter,
smattering of applause ]

00:02:23.142 --> 00:02:25.145
I never do this during the show,

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:27.413
but we're going
to stop it all down

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.581
and make everybody
watch "Grease."

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.617
[ Laughter,
smattering of applause ]

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:33.753
[ Laughing ]
A man --

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:35.087
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:37.590
A man in South Dakota
was arrested recently

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.558
after his mother served brownies

00:02:39.558 --> 00:02:41.260
that he made
with marijuana butter

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.362
at a senior center.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:44.163
Caretakers became suspicious

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:45.398
when that night's comedian

00:02:45.398 --> 00:02:46.399
got laughs.

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:49.001
[ Laughter,
smattering of applause ]

00:02:49.001 --> 00:02:51.337
The FDA last week approved
the first treatment

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.506
to control arthritis pain
for cats.

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.274
It will replace
the old treatment --

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:57.009
a brick and a burlap sack.

00:02:57.009 --> 00:02:59.045
[ Laughter and booing ]

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:07.153
We got to clear the palate!

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:09.189
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:12.992
[ Laughing ]
And, finally --

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.661
And, finally,
according to a new study,

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:18.398
men who live alone for years are
at a greater risk

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:19.899
of developing inflammation.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:22.868
It's just a lot of stress
to put on one wrist.

00:03:22.868 --> 00:03:24.904
[ Laughter, ohs, and applause ]

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:31.711
Makes you reassess
the dead cat joke, though.

00:03:31.711 --> 00:03:34.680
[ Laughter ]

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:35.748
That was the monologue.

